        "solution_text": "To the nearest degree the cut is after the degrees, so the critical unit is $29'$.\n$29<30$, so the angle rounds down to $56^{\\circ}$.\nTo the nearest minute the cut is after the minutes, so the critical unit is $45''$.\n$45\\geq 30$, so the minutes round up to $30'$, giving $56^{\\circ}\\,30'$.\nThe two answers differ because each rounding looks at a different critical unit."
